coverage/
*.local

# The root .gitignore ignores *.png; re-include the committed reference plates and
# win32 Playwright baselines so evidence lives in the repo (strategy_ll §9, risk §9).
!e2e/design-reference/*.png
!e2e/**/*-snapshots/**/*.png
!e2e/__screenshots__/**/*.png

# Run evidence (screenshots, measurement JSON) is written by the specs under e2e/evidence/ and is
# NOT version-controlled (S16, owner ask m-669eca70f3): cite it on the board (artifact_upload /
# report doc), not in git. Only the README that says so is tracked.
e2e/evidence/*
!e2e/evidence/README.md
